WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
France is Western Europe's cultural capital, bordered by the Atlantic Ocean and the Mediterranean.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mont Blanc in the French Alps rises to 4,808 meters, towering as Western Europe's highest peak.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
In Paris, the wrought-iron Eiffel Tower stands 330 meters high on the Champ de Mars.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
The French language is regulated by the Académie Française founded in 1635 by Cardinal Richelieu.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
French haute cuisine and traditional Baguette baking are inscribed on UNESCO's heritage lists.

